# Atmosphere — the autonomous clock
#
# The world doesn't only wait for scans. The host ticks a steady clock
# while the doors are open and these ambient generators emit a bark per
# interval, cycled deterministically. None of them touch any individual
# guest — they're pure mood. The threat in this world is reactive, not
# ambient.

GENERATOR FeedHum
  tier: ambient
  every 20s
  yield bark from The feed scrolls on, indifferent. | Somewhere a notification chimes. | The Algorithm is always watching. | The walls of the Internet hum.

GENERATOR GlitchStatic
  tier: ambient
  every 25s
  yield bark from A pixel flickers where it shouldn't. | Static crawls across a dead channel. | For half a second, an exit sign that isn't there.

GENERATOR AlgoWhisper
  tier: ambient
  every 35s
  yield bark from The Algorithm recalculates. | Your engagement has been noted. | Recommended for you: obedience.

GENERATOR Notifications
  tier: ambient
  every 45s
  yield bark from 3 people liked your existence. | A stranger is typing... | Your screen time is up 400% this hour.
